          "description": [
            "Interactive NMF-based decomposition workflow of genome-scale datasets.\n\nShinyButchR is an interactive R/Shiny app to perform NMF on an input matrix. ShinyButchR uses ButchR (https://github.com/wurst-theke/ButchR) to run the matrix decomposition and generate diagnostic plots and visualizations that helps to find association of the NMF signatures to known biological factors.\n\nButchR is an R package providing functions to perform non-negative matrix factorization and postprocessing using TensorFlow."
